msgid "Changes take effect from the next child process that starts (no restart needed). Processes that ignore proxy settings cannot be controlled even when this is enabled. Child processes unrelated to AI, such as npm used by language servers or extensions, are not covered even when this is enabled."
msgstr "變更會從下一個啟動的子處理序開始生效（不需重新啟動）。即使啟用此項，也無法管控忽略 Proxy 設定的處理序。即使啟用此項，與 AI 無關的子處理序（例如語言伺服器或擴充功能使用的 npm）也不在範圍內。"

