msgid "Closes the settings window and launches Claude Code in a tab of the agent panel. For a local project on Windows it runs inside the sandbox (WSL); on a Linux host connected over SSH it runs inside that host's sandbox."
msgstr "關閉設定視窗，並在代理面板的分頁中啟動 Claude Code。在 Windows 上的本機專案中，它會在沙箱（WSL）內執行；在透過 SSH 連線的 Linux 主機上，它會在該主機的沙箱內執行。"

msgid "Closes the settings window and launches `claude` on this PC (on the SSH host, when connected over SSH) outside the sandbox. Asks for confirmation every time (unless \"Always Launch Outside the Sandbox\" below is on)."
msgstr "關閉設定視窗，並在沙箱外啟動這台電腦上的 `claude`（透過 SSH 連線時為 SSH 主機上的）。每次都會要求確認（除非開啟了下方的「一律在沙箱外啟動」）。"

msgid "Closes the settings window and opens the file in the editor. Creates the file if it does not exist"
msgstr "關閉設定視窗，並在編輯器中開啟檔案。若檔案不存在則會建立"

msgid "Closes the settings window and runs the official install command `npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code` in the integrated terminal. Requires Node.js (npm)."
msgstr "關閉設定視窗，並在整合式終端機中執行官方安裝命令 `npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code`。需要 Node.js（npm）。"

msgid "Closing AI tabs in the built-in browser"
msgstr "關閉內建瀏覽器中的 AI 分頁"

